# obsolete-upstream/ — patches that are NOT applied

Two patches from the t2linux 6.1 set are excluded because their changes are
already present in the kernel this board builds. Applying them fails with
"Reversed (or previously applied) patch detected".

They are kept here, unapplied, so the delta against t2linux stays auditable.

The parent `files/` directory is what cros-kernel2's `apply_private_patches`
globs (`${FILESDIR}/*.patch`). This subdirectory is never matched — the glob
does not descend — so nothing here reaches the build.

---

