| Patch's own `From:` sha | `07a714fc9a7ac7d9313816c365a8c2fd7ee9cb81` |
| Merged upstream as | `5476fcf7f7b901db1cea92acb1abdd12609e30e1` (committed 2022-11-02) |
| First mainline release | **v6.2** (absent in v6.1) |
| Backported to stable as | `508cc67f944905b7a777d6e70d0e6f9962c3c6e3` (2022-12-31) |
| First stable release | **v6.1.2** |

Note the `From:` sha in the patch file is the pre-merge mailing-list revision
(v2 1/2). It does **not** exist in mainline — the maintainer's applied commit
has a different sha, which is the one listed above.

